---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Property Maintenance Log Ghana | Track Repairs &amp; Vendors" description="Track maintenance requests, vendors, costs, and unit inventory across your properties. Available in 3 tiers: Landlord, Manager, Portfolio.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/products/" style="color:#516784; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:1rem; display:inline-block;">← Back to Products</a>

      <h1>Maintenance Request Log</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="max-width:680px; margin-bottom:2rem;">Track maintenance requests, vendors, costs, and unit inventory across your properties. Organize by property, unit, status, and completion date. Perfect for landlords managing single properties or managers overseeing multiple portfolios.</p>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">What's Included</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Interactive HTML App:</strong> Fillable form with request tracking, vendor management, and cost calculations</li>
          <li><strong>Automated Register:</strong> Excel workbook with auto-summing maintenance costs</li>
          <li><strong>Unit Inventory:</strong> Track all units across properties</li>
          <li><strong>Vendor Database:</strong> Contact information and performance tracking</li>
          <li><strong>Cost Analysis:</strong> Breakdown by property, unit, vendor, and maintenance type</li>
          <li><strong>PDF Guide:</strong> Step-by-step instructions for property managers</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp Cards:</strong> 5 marketing cards for social media promotion (Portfolio tier only)</li>
          <li><strong>All files are offline-first:</strong> No subscriptions, no cloud required. Works entirely in your browser or Excel.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0;">
        <h2>Choose Your Tier</h2>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap:1.5rem; margin-top:1.5rem;">

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Landlord</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Perfect for individual property owners managing 1 property with up to 15 units.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 49</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>1 property</li>
              <li>Up to 15 units</li>
              <li>HTML app + Excel register</li>
              <li>PDF guide</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/9380s42111" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Manager</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">For property managers handling multiple properties and unlimited units.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 99</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>Unlimited properties</li>
              <li>Unlimited units</li>
              <li>HTML app + Excel register</li>
              <li>PDF guide</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/5712z42216" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Portfolio</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Complete suite with all features, WhatsApp marketing cards, and templates.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 179</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>Unlimited properties</li>
              <li>Unlimited units</li>
              <li>HTML app + Excel register</li>
              <li>PDF guide + templates</li>
              <li>5 WhatsApp cards</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/36o104c137" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h3>How It Works</h3>
        <ol style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li>Open the HTML app in any web browser</li>
          <li>Fill in property and unit details</li>
          <li>Log each maintenance request with vendor info and cost</li>
          <li>Export to Excel for detailed analysis</li>
          <li>Track trends and budgets across all properties</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#fff3cd; border-radius:8px;">
        <p style="margin:0;"><strong>Act 220 Compliant:</strong> Meets Ghana's Rent Act, 1963 requirements for property maintenance documentation and tenant dispute resolution.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:3rem 0; text-align:center;">
        <a href="/contact/" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Have Questions? Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
